---
description: Task management rules
globs:
  - 02_tasks/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---
When modifying task files:
- All tasks must have YAML front matter with required fields: id, type, area, status, created, updated.
- Use 30-minute resolution for time estimates (0.5h, 1h, 1.5h, 2h, etc.).
- Complex tasks (>1h, need 2+ sessions) should suggest breakdown automatically.
- Tasks are candidates until scheduled into a day file's focus block.
- Never delete tasks; archive via status=archived/done.
- Completed tasks use strikethrough: `- [x] ~~Task description~~`
